WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.482
Project Report  ·  Worked example

00:00:00.482 --> 00:00:01.512
Calculate the residential project and open its coordinated structural report.

00:00:01.512 --> 00:00:05.761
Choose Full project pack + layouts to include the calculations and marked residential drawing.

00:00:05.761 --> 00:00:08.102
Read the report index, then open the post action schedule for P01.

00:00:08.102 --> 00:00:11.502
Follow the worked equations from the action combination and units to the numerical substitution.

00:00:11.502 --> 00:00:14.002
Inspect the 125 PFC beam dossier for section properties, load combinations and diagrams.

00:00:14.002 --> 00:00:17.413
Review open design decisions before the responsible engineer approves the structure.
